@baseUrl = https://localhost:7240

### Submit an inquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rider",
  "email": "rider@example.com",
  "message": "I have a suggestion for the catalog."
}

### List inquiries (requires an active administrator session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/contact-inquiries?page=1&pageSize=20

### Delete an inquiry (requires an active administrator session and allowed Origin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/contact-inquiries/1
Origin: https://localhost:3001
